+## 头脑风暴衍生的变体（阶段 5.1.5）
 
-Runs only when:
-- Phase 0.2 found upstream brainstorm doc (brainstorm-sourced invocation)
-- AND not on Phase 0.1 fast paths
+仅在以下情况下运行：
+- 阶段 0.2 找到上游头脑风暴文档（头脑风暴来源的调用）
+- 并且不在阶段 0.1 快速路径上
 
-**Content focus**: plan-time decisions only. The brainstorm and its synthesis already validated WHAT to build; the internal draft and stage 2 show HOW the plan will execute that work — decisions the brainstorm did not make.
+**内容重点**：仅限计划时决策。头脑风暴及其综合已经验证了要构建什么；内部草案和第二阶段显示了计划将如何执行这项工作——头脑风暴没有做出的决定。
 
-Items to include in the internal draft:
